WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.502
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.970
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.005
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:09.509
The Conservative Political
Action Conference, or CPAC,

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:12.979
kicked off today in Texas,
and former president Trump will

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:14.614
speak on the last day
of the event.

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:18.150
He's expected to talk about
taxes, gun rights, immigration,

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:22.421
Bugs Bunny, pretzels, the 2003
Chevy Camaro, Mr. Met,

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:24.890
Selina Gomez,
the canceled "Batgirl" movie,

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.160
and the final episode of "MASH,"
and lastly,

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.895
why hot dogs are sandwiches.

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.462
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.462 --> 00:00:32.699
President Biden tested positive

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:34.266
for the coronavirus again
yesterday.

00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:37.370
Or as he's thinking of it,
a second term.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.806
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:42.509
Former vice president Mike Pence
is expected to hold

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:44.677
a fundraiser later this month
in the Hamptons.

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:47.447
So if you think you bumped into
Mike Pence in the Hamptons

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:49.649
this month,
that's just what every man

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:51.150
in the Hamptons looks like.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.286
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:56.923
The Senate yesterday ratified
Finland and Sweden's application

00:00:56.923 --> 00:01:01.327
to join NATO in a 95-1 vote with
Republican Senator Josh Hawley

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:03.596
the only lawmaker
to oppose the move.

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:07.467
Well, he's always been an every
man for himself kind of guy.

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:10.103
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:12.938
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:12.938 --> 00:01:15.274
The CDC this week is reportedly

00:01:15.274 --> 00:01:18.410
expected to ease its coronavirus
guidance recommendations.

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:21.981
Though I don't know how it could
be any more eased.

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:24.717
Nobody's wearing masks.
The restaurants are full.

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:27.654
Do they want us to kiss
the waiter before we order?

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:29.789
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:33.225
Today was former president
Barack Obama's 61st birthday.

00:01:33.225 --> 00:01:36.162
Said Obama,
"Joe, it's 3:00 a.m."

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:39.131
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.131 --> 00:01:41.200
"But I was the first one.
Right, pal?"

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.802
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:47.140
"First birthday wish of
the year, right?

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.841
This job is so hard, buddy."

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:51.377
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.212
"Keep getting coronavirus."

00:01:53.212 --> 00:01:58.751
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:01.187
It was announced yesterday that
the long-running soap opera

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:03.123
"Days of Our Lives"
will move next month

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:05.258
from NBC to the streaming
platform Peacock.

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:07.093
So if you're a big fan of
"Days of Our Lives,"

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:08.828
you're never going to
find Peacock.

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:10.229
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:11.664
"Is it channel eight?"

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:14.233
"No, Grandma,
it's not a channel."

00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:15.568
"What?"

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:19.372
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:22.007
A Chick-fil-A restaurant
in North Carolina is facing

00:02:22.007 --> 00:02:24.744
criticism after it was looking
for volunteers to work

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:28.214
at the location's drive-through
who'd be given five free entrees

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:30.582
for a one-hour shift
instead of being paid.

00:02:30.582 --> 00:02:32.351
Perhaps most offensive --

00:02:32.351 --> 00:02:35.421
calling a sandwich from
Chick-fil-A an entree.

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:40.259
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.259 --> 00:02:42.895
The discount department store
corporation that operates

00:02:42.895 --> 00:02:45.431
T.J. Maxx, Marshall's,
and HomeGoods recently agreed

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:47.833
to pay a $13 million fine
for selling

00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:50.336
recalled infant sleeper
products.

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:53.172
Okay, I knew this felt unsafe.

00:02:53.172 --> 00:03:01.046
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.046 --> 00:03:03.482
In a new interview, Green Bay
Packers quarterback

00:03:03.482 --> 00:03:05.718
Aaron Rodgers said that
his experience taking

00:03:05.718 --> 00:03:08.554
the psychoactive tea ayahuasca
led him to having

00:03:08.554 --> 00:03:10.189
the best football season
of his career.

00:03:10.189 --> 00:03:11.457
As opposed to Tom Brady

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:14.060
who credits a mysterious
painting up in his attic.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.763
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:19.632
Tomorrow is
National Underwear Day.

00:03:19.632 --> 00:03:21.167
Already?

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:23.469
Man, it really creeps up on you.

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:29.709
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:32.378
[ Applause ]
And finally -- Don't encourage.

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:35.948
And finally, a woman
in Minnesota has set

00:03:35.948 --> 00:03:38.885
a Guinness world record for
world's longest fingernails.

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:41.086
Also, world's worst texter.

00:03:41.086 --> 00:03:42.755
And that --
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:44.257
That was the monologue,
everybody.

